<Layout title="Forex & Gold Position Size Calculator | Lot Size by Risk" description="Free TRADE90 forex and gold position size calculator. Enter USD balance, risk percentage, stop-loss pips or gold price distance, and transaction cost buffer to estimate lots and potential cash loss." canonical="/tools/position-size-calculator/">
